<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">02 / 初步推荐示例</view>
  <view class="title">三个值得了解的方向</view>
  <view class="notice">Mock 演示数据，非真实 AI 评估。三个岗位和依据为固定示例，与本次答案无关；不包含匹配分数或个人能力评分。</view>
  <view class="muted">{{preview ? '当前为示例预览，不创建或修改你的答题进度。' : '已走完画像与两轮 Mock 追问。以下仍是固定示例，未对你的回答进行评价。'}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{needsProfile}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">请先完成画像与两轮追问</view>
    <view class="muted">主流程需要完整答题与追问记录；首页示例预览独立于答题进度。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="editProfile">前往基础画像</button>
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="followup">继续 Mock 追问</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">正在读取本地演示数据…</view>
    <view class="muted">{{scenario === 'timeout' ? '正在模拟 15 秒等待，结束后显示固定降级模板。可以返回上一页。' : '这里不调用 AI，也不会上传你的回答。'}}</view>
    <button class="secondary" loading disabled>请稍候</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card">
    <view class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="retry">重试读取正常 Mock</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{cards.length === 0}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">暂时没有演示推荐</view>
    <view class="muted">这是空状态演示，不代表你没有适合探索的方向。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="retry">重新读取正常 Mock</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{statusMessage}}" class="notice">{{statusMessage}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="localId" class="card">
      <view class="badge">固定示例 {{index + 1}} · Mock</view>
      <view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="subtitle">{{item.introduction}}</view>
      <view class="reason">{{item.exampleReason}}</view>
      <view class="dimension-list"><text wx:for="{{item.focusDimensions}}" wx:for-item="dimension" wx:key="*this" class="dimension">{{dimension}}</text></view>
      <view class="muted">以上为岗位关注能力，不是你的个人画像。</view>
      <button class="secondary" data-role="{{item.localId}}" bindtap="trial">体验 4 分钟 Mock 试岗</button>
    </view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{warning}}" class="error">{{warning}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!needsProfile}}" class="card debug-panel">
    <view class="card-title">Mock 状态验收工具</view>
    <view class="muted">仅用于本地 Mock 状态检查。当前场景：{{scenario}}</view>
    <view class="scenario-buttons">
      <button class="secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" data-scenario="normal" bindtap="simulate">正常</button>
      <button class="secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" data-scenario="empty" bindtap="simulate">空状态</button>
      <button class="secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" data-scenario="error" bindtap="simulate">错误</button>
      <button class="secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" data-scenario="degraded" bindtap="simulate">降级</button>
      <button class="secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" data-scenario="timeout" bindtap="simulate">15 秒超时</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="actions">
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="editProfile">{{preview ? '开始基础画像' : '修改基础画像'}}</button>
    <button class="link-button" bindtap="followup">返回 Mock 追问</button>
    <button class="link-button" bindtap="home">返回首页</button>
  </view>
</view>
